    "detailed_description": "JumpHigher showcases unique gameplay features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMouse Aim Control: Direct your character's orientation simply by pointing the mouse.<br />\r\nDynamic Jumping: Hold spacebar to leap; the longer you hold, the farther you jump.<br />\r\nFart Boost: Upon landing, emit a fart that blasts zombies away!<br />\r\nZombie Variety: Encounter diverse zombies intent on halting your ascent.<br />\r\nDay-Night Cycle: Face intensified zombie threats during nightfall.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on your thrilling, skyward adventure today!",
